the test  in humorous iterations of the problem. Unlock a variety of minigames where you can put your gaming skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/Gift_C.gif?t=1748929768\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself and learn important and useful philosophical knowledge while expanding your mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 20 trolley problem variations (plus the original)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 20 minigames inspired by each variation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Disclaimer: You might not actually learn anything useful or important, nor expand your mind, by playing this game.</i></p>","developers":["byDanDans"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/header.jpg?t=1748929768","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101033,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101033/movie480.mp4?t=1745596930","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101033/movie_max.mp4?t=1745596930"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101033/9cd20a3d6023444c98af73726e02ad6ea431eba2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745596930","webm":{"480":